        <body>
            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0604" n="500" xml:id="pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4534: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan (Forbes) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-03T17:00:00+09:00">March 3, 1932—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 3—6:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>88. Japanese General Staff announces that further forward advance of Japanese
                    Army at Shanghai will in general cease after today’s movements are
                    completed.</p>
                <p>The papers announce complete general withdrawal of 19th Chinese Route Army.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Forbes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
